{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/225372-rest-in-peace-robin-williams","id":225372,"title":"Rest in peace, Robin Williams","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-11T16:09:39-07:00","id":225372,"title":"Rest in peace, Robin Williams","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/news/ni57586957/?ref_=hm_nw_tp_t1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/news/ni57586957/?ref_=hm_nw_tp_t1\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/news/ni57586957/?ref_=hm_nw_tp_t1\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.imdb.com/news/ni57586957/?ref_=hm_nw_tp_t1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's being implied that his death is a suicide, though details aren't available at this time. I'm stunned by this, to say the least; I can barely even process it. He's been a figure I admire very much, and to think he's gone...well, forget what it means to me. Love and support to his family, who must be having it much harder than I ever could be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T16:31:37-07:00","id":225392,"title":"","content":"...<br /> <br /> I don't believe that's even possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T16:43:37-07:00","id":225405,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.cnn.com/2014/08/11/showbiz/robin-williams-dead/index.html?hpt=hp_t1\" target=\"_blank\">Comedian Robin Williams dead, sheriff says</a><br /> <br /> <i>Coroner investigators suspect &quot;the death to be a suicide due to asphyxia,&quot; according to a statement from the Marin County, California, Sheriff's office.<br /> <br /> &quot;Robin Williams passed away this morning,&quot; his media representative Mara Buxbaum told CNN.<br /> <br /> &quot;He has been battling severe depression of late. This is a tragic and sudden loss. The family respectfully asks for their privacy as they grieve during this very difficult time.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> ------------------<br /> <br /> Dead Poets Society was a favorite.<br /> <br /> Seems appropriate;<br /> <br /> O Captain! My Captain<br /> By Walt Whitman<br /> <br /> <i>O Captain! my Captain! our fearful trip is done,<br /> The ship has weather\u2019d every rack, the prize we sought is won,<br /> The port is near, the bells I hear, the people all exulting,<br /> While follow eyes the steady keel, the vessel grim and daring;<br /> <br /> But O heart! heart! heart!<br /> O the bleeding drops of red,<br /> Where on the deck my Captain lies,<br /> Fallen cold and dead.<br /> <br /> O Captain! my Captain! rise up and hear the bells;<br /> Rise up\u2014for you the flag is flung\u2014for you the bugle trills,<br /> For you bouquets and ribbon\u2019d wreaths\u2014for you the shores a-crowding,<br /> For you they call, the swaying mass, their eager faces turning;<br /> <br /> Here Captain! dear father!<br /> The arm beneath your head!<br /> It is some dream that on the deck,<br /> You\u2019ve fallen cold and dead.<br /> <br /> My Captain does not answer, his lips are pale and still,<br /> My father does not feel my arm, he has no pulse nor will,<br /> The ship is anchor\u2019d safe and sound, its voyage closed and done,<br /> From fearful trip the victor ship comes in with object won;<br /> <br /> Exult O shores, and ring O bells!<br /> But I with mournful tread,<br /> Walk the deck my Captain lies,<br /> Fallen cold and dead.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T17:00:41-07:00","id":225415,"title":"","content":"Part of me was hoping this was some horrible Internet hoax. He seemed too happy a guy to have this happen to him. I'm still somewhat in shock over this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"