ith-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LaJDOD5cJI&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-code=\"4LaJDOD5cJI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/4LaJDOD5cJI/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T08:47:03-07:00","id":226001,"title":"","content":"Wow, just heard about this! I can hardly believe it either, but I'm now watching CNN's retrospective of his life...Some of my earliest memories are of watching him on Mork and Mindy, and it seemed like he'd always be there...It was even better learning that he was a Geek like we are! I concur, this hits harder than pretty much any recent celebrity death...<br /> <br /> Much love to his family and friends, who have it even worse then we do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T11:05:01-07:00","id":226113,"title":"","content":"I saw this this morning and I was totally shocked too. He was such a big kid and it was awesome to watch him. If it was suicide it is really really sad that in that moment he lost that joy.<br /> <br /> RIP Robin Williams and thank you for all the laughs and joy you've given us over the years. Best wishes to his family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T11:42:46-07:00","id":226159,"title":"","content":"David Wong of Cracked.com has written a really poignant article, that I think some people on this board might be able to relate to and might be enlightening to others (it was a bit for me, at least). The comments section is also very touching as long as you sort it by votes to avoid most of the trolls.<br /> Here is the link:<br /> <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/quick-fixes/robin-williams-why-funny-people-kill-themselves/\" target=\"_blank\">Robin Williams and Why Funny People Kill Themselves</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T12:23:31-07:00","id":226195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/225372-rest-in-peace-robin-williams?p=226159#post226159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">David Wong of Cracked.com has written a really poignant article, that I think some people on this board might be able to relate to and might be enlightening to others (it was a bit for me, at least). The comments section is also very touching as long as you sort it by votes to avoid most of the trolls.<br /> Here is the link:<br /> <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/quick-fixes/robin-williams-why-funny-people-kill-themselves/\" target=\"_blank\">Robin Williams and Why Funny People Kill Themselves</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Just read it, don't like it for the simple fact that it's lead in is that he committed suicide. I greatly dislike such statements being made as fact when they are currently nothing but speculation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T07:52:54-07:00","id":227021,"title":"","content":"On the positive side, as someone who works in the mental health field, we've seen an upswing in the number of patients calling for appointments since Monday. So, among the positive contributions of his life and death can be added: throwing a spot light on mental illness (again) and not as just another &quot;only serial killer maniacs need help like that&quot; case, but in the &quot;wow, he had all that and still couldn't handle it, why the hell aren't <b>I </b>in therapy?&quot; way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 08-13-2014, 11:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}